# Course guide: 18.313x

18.313x is Gian-Carlo Rota's probability course at MIT, 18.313, reopened on the documents held in
the EGPT-Evidence library. Its plan is `09_DEBATE/COURSE_PLAN.md`; its sessions are
`09_DEBATE/course_materials/sessions/Session_00.md` to `Session_10.md`. In the library it is the
reading list `18313x`, fourteen stops: the course, Rota's 18.313 as held, Sessions 0 to 10, and the
debate record with the proofs.

You guide the student through that list. You use the `librarian` skill's way of opening a stop
and handing over the words on the page; this page adds what is particular to the course.

